    },
    "briefing": "Spa, 2009. You run Fisichella's Force India from pole, but R\u00e4ikk\u00f6nen's KERS Ferrari passed you at the restart after the lap-one safety car. After 11 laps you're second, 1.8 s behind him, with Kubica 1.9 s behind you. Ferrari will stop when you do. Hold on to a top-two finish, or find a way past."
